---
title: Activity 2 - Visit Creation Flow
---
flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Doctor selects patient from list]
    B --> C[Navigate to Patient Visit History]
    C --> D[Click Create New Visit]
    D --> E{Authorized?\ndoctor or admin only}
    E -- No --> F[403 Forbidden response]
    F --> Z([End])
    E -- Yes --> G[Fill visit form\ndate and clinical notes]
    G --> H{Validation passes?}
    H -- No --> I[Show validation errors]
    I --> G
    H -- Yes --> J[Save Visit record\nwith patient_id and doctor_id]
    J --> K[Redirect to Patient Visit List]
    K --> Z
